summary: Ensure sufficient memory is reserved for qcom_scm to load.
description: |
    Ensure sufficient memory is reserved for qcom_scm to load by chekcing
    the boot messages using journalctl.
    Test Inputs:
        kernel message logs.
    Expected results:
        [   PASS   ] :: Command 'journalctl -k | grep 'qcom_scm firmware:scm: assigned reserved memory node.*'' (Expected 0, got 0)
    Results location:
        output.txt
contact: Stephen Bertram <sbertram@redhat.com>
component:
  - kernel
adjust+:
    when: hw_target != ridesx4 or hw_target is not defined
    enabled: false
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
duration: 10m
id: ac081e09-f6bf-4e12-b899-54312ab5db1d
